  "info": {
    "title": "Basalt Beat",
    "author": "Atomik",
    "notes": "A slow, broken beat in A minor at 96 BPM: a deep sampled kit with a syncopated kick and ghosted snare, a round walking sub, a dry clavier on four chords and a wooden mallet hook that comes in halfway. Sixteen bars of sparse hats, the full groove and a heavier half-time ending. The drum kits and pattern clips: a sampled kit, drum patterns looped over bars, effect containers as channel inserts and on the master."
  },
